# A misspelled join kind: DS0123 with a did-you-mean fix.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | join kind = fullouterr 'customers.csv' on customerId
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..68
  PIPELINE@0..67
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    JOIN_OP@15..67
      IDENT@15..19 "join"
      WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
      JOIN_KIND@20..37
        IDENT@20..24 "kind"
        WHITESPACE@24..25 " "
        EQ@25..26 "="
        WHITESPACE@26..27 " "
        IDENT@27..37 "fullouterr"
      WHITESPACE@37..38 " "
      LITERAL@38..53
        STRING@38..53 "'customers.csv'"
      WHITESPACE@53..54 " "
      IDENT@54..56 "on"
      WHITESPACE@56..57 " "
      NAME_REF@57..67
        IDENT@57..67 "customerId"
  WHITESPACE@67..68 "\n"

error[DS0123]: unknown join kind `fullouterr`
  --> query:1:28
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | join kind = fullouterr 'customers.csv' on customerId
  |                            ^^^^^^^^^^ not a join kind
  |
  = help: write `kind = fullouter`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    'orders.csv' | join kind = fullouter 'customers.csv' on customerId
which parses without errors
